<title>MEXICO: Mexico 1996-1997 final sugar harvest update.</title>
<headline>Mexico 1996-1997 final sugar harvest update.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's Agroindustry Sugar Committee weekly harvest update for the 1996-1997 (Nov/July) sugar crop to July 19 (sugar, in tonnes) --</p>
<p>Activity in week July 13-July 19</p>
<p>    Harvest	Cane milled	Sugar Output    Yield</p>
<p>     96-97	  15,331 tns	    715 tns     4.67 pct</p>
<p>     95-96	  25,095 tns	  2,566 tns    10.22 pct</p>
<p>     94-95	  15,102 tns	  1,135 tns     7.52 pct</p>
<p>Total activity to July 19</p>
<p>    Harvest	Cane milled	Sugar Output    Yield</p>
<p>     96-97    42,170,673 tns    4,543,851 tns    10.77 pct</p>
<p>     95-96    40,185,213 tns    4,377,453 tns    10.89 pct</p>
<p>     94-95    40,124,379 tns    4,277,394 tns    10.66 pct</p>
<p>The committee reported this was its final update for this 1996-1997 harvest.</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom +525 728 9530))</p>
